(AutoVet's inventory forecast learns each item's usage per day from the clinic's usage history and estimates when) Tj
T* (stock will reach its minimum level. Because almost no usage was recorded from June 2026, 19 of 41 items could) Tj
T* (not be forecast. The missing weeks were filled with 1122 generated records whose rates, weekly pattern and) Tj
T* (growth were all learned from a full year of existing historical records, with day-to-day variation drawn from a) Tj
T* (Poisson distribution. The forecast was then measured with R2, RMSE, MAE and an 80/20 time split, using the) Tj
T* (same formulas as the system's evaluation guide.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.094 0.094 0.106 rg
45.354330708661422 634.3939370078740012 Td
(For demonstration, the same months were also filled with 4807 invoices, as many completed appointments, and) Tj
T* (78 new clients with pets, at the daily rates of the historical records, so the dashboard and analytics pages show) Tj
T* (continuous activity. All generated records are labelled and removable.) Tj
ET
